        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        80.14361572265625,
        505.7167053222656,
        109.03961181640625
      ],
      "text": "7.\t M -  TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        145.39939880371094,
        87.01241302490234,
        452.4773864746094,
        107.23960876464844
      ],
      "text": "anagement of drug resistant",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03939819335938,
        114.61238861083984,
        236.5460968017578,
        134.83958435058594
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        146.72218322753906,
        130.37139892578125,
        163.57818603515625
      ],
      "text": "7.1\t C",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.5872039794922,
        150.72898864746094,
        235.6632537841797,
        162.52818298339844
      ],
      "text": "hapter objectives",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        171.27099609375,
        513.4606323242188,
        184.62249755859375
      ],
      "text": "This chapter describes recurring TB or drug-resistant TB (DR-TB) and the challenges of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        187.26751708984375,
        292.3269348144531,
        200.6190185546875
      ],
      "text": "diagnosing and treating DR-TB in children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        222.6339874267578,
        125.70940399169922,
        239.489990234375
      ],
      "text": "7.2\t I",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        125.92539978027344,
        226.6407928466797,
        200.44459533691406,
        238.4399871826172
      ],
      "text": "ntroduction",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        247.18280029296875,
        513.4260864257812,
        260.5343017578125
      ],
      "text": "WHO has published guidelines for the approach to diagnosis and treatment of DR-TB,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        263.1103210449219,
        513.4835815429688,
        276.53082275390625
      ],
      "text": "(1, 2).  based on experience in adults; the most recent version was updated in 2011",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        279.17584228515625,
        513.4144897460938,
        292.52734375
      ],
      "text": "The grade of evidence for all recommendations was very low. Available data to inform",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        295.17236328125,
        513.471923828125,
        308.52386474609375
      ],
      "text": "management guidelines specific for children are even more limited, although pragmatic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        311.0998840332031,
        513.3915405273438,
        324.5203857421875
      ],
      "text": "(3-6) guides based on clinical experience have been published . There is no consensus on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        327.1653747558594,
        371.0673828125,
        340.5168762207031
      ],
      "text": "preventive therapy for high-risk contacts of MDR-TB cases.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        362.54583740234375,
        131.92539978027344,
        379.4018249511719
      ],
      "text": "7.3\t D",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        132.1414031982422,
        366.5526123046875,
        182.6015625,
        378.3518371582031
      ],
      "text": "iagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        387.0946044921875,
        305.9543762207031,
        400.44610595703125
      ],
      "text": "Drug-resistant TB should be suspected when:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        409.39849853515625,
        297.2903137207031,
        422.864990234375
      ],
      "text": "there is contact with known DR-TB;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        428.8678283691406,
        513.386962890625,
        442.3343200683594
      ],
      "text": "there is contact with suspected DR-TB, i.e. source case is a treatment failure or a  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.48930358886719,
        442.6678161621094,
        329.8468017578125,
        456.0193176269531
      ],
      "text": "retreatment case or recently died from TB;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        462.1371154785156,
        472.8149108886719,
        475.6036071777344
      ],
      "text": "a child with TB is not responding to first-line therapy despite adherence; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        482.2064208984375,
        452.9773254394531,
        495.67291259765625
      ],
      "text": "a child previously treated for TB presents with recurrence of disease. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        503.87567138671875,
        513.3916015625,
        517.2271728515625
      ],
      "text": "When DR-TB is suspected, every effort should be made to confirm the diagnosis by",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        519.8721923828125,
        513.380126953125,
        533.2236938476562
      ],
      "text": "obtaining specimens for culture and drug susceptibility testing (DST). Rapid DST of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        535.8687133789062,
        513.4030151367188,
        549.22021484375
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid and rifampicin or of rifampicin alone is recommended over conventional",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        551.8651733398438,
        513.4835815429688,
        565.2166748046875
      ],
      "text": "testing or no testing at the time of diagnosis. The use of molecular tests (line probe",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        567.8616333007812,
        513.46044921875,
        581.213134765625
      ],
      "text": "assay and Xpert MTB/RIF) may provide evidence of resistance within hours to 1-2 days",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        583.858154296875,
        513.3914794921875,
        597.2096557617188
      ],
      "text": "of specimen testing and is endorsed by WHO (see Chapter 3); conventional DST, by",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        599.8546752929688,
        510.2059020996094,
        613.2061767578125
      ],
      "text": "contrast, may take 1-3 months to yield results. Rapid DST may therefore provide a cost-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        615.8511962890625,
        513.4718017578125,
        629.2026977539062
      ],
      "text": "effective means of achieving early treatment, increased cure rates, reduced mortality,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        631.8477172851562,
        513.3914184570312,
        645.19921875
      ],
      "text": "reduced development of additional drug resistance and a lowered probability of failure",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        647.8441772460938,
        513.4950561523438,
        661.1956787109375
      ],
      "text": "and relapse. In all cases of confirmed MDR-TB, second-line DST should be performed to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        663.8406982421875,
        424.9678955078125,
        677.1921997070312
      ],
      "text": "exclude XDR-TB and to help establish an effective treatment regimen.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        688.2782592773438,
        475.7289733886719,
        701.69873046875
      ],
      "text": "(4) Figure 4 shows a diagnostic algorithm for the diagnosis of DR-TB in children  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "65",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}